# PLAN-902 a2r-hir record-text — R07 (frozen ace-m1 bytes, provenance
# ../ace-m1/src/R07.at, sha256 6d07888a…): a `mut` record parameter whose
# field write is visible to the caller (write-back through the exclusive
# borrow), BorrowMut call-site marker, field-path read/write. Oracle 42 =
# bump result 21 + caller-visible x.value 21. The golden four-file set was
# frozen from a real worker emission and re-verified deterministic across
# nonces; the certification leg (real rustc compile+run vs the independent
# reference) is the explicit certify axis, not this daily check.

```test-case
